{"slug":"m-l-k","ar":"م ل ك","total":206,"core":"possessing; sovereignty; angels","forms":[{"ar":"مَلَك","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":88,"gloss":"Angels","word":"al-malaikah","ex":{"s":15,"a":30,"p":2,"ar":["فَسَجَدَ","ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","كُلُّهُمْ","أَجْمَعُونَ"],"en":"So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely"}},{"ar":"مُلْك","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":48,"gloss":"Kingdom, dominion, sovereignty","word":"mulk","ex":{"s":38,"a":20,"p":2,"ar":["وَشَدَدْنَا","مُلْكَهُۥ","وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","ٱلْحِكْمَةَ","وَفَصْلَ","ٱلْخِطَابِ"],"en":"And We strengthened his kingdom and gave him wisdom and discernment in speech"}},{"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":44,"gloss":"to possess, have power","word":null,"ex":{"s":72,"a":21,"p":4,"ar":["قُلْ","إِنِّى","لَآ","أَمْلِكُ","لَكُمْ","ضَرًّا","وَلَا","رَشَدًا"],"en":"Say, \"Indeed, I do not possess for you [the power of] harm or right direction"}},{"ar":"مَلِك","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":15,"gloss":"The King, The Sovereign","word":"al-malik","ex":{"s":114,"a":2,"p":1,"ar":["مَلِكِ","ٱلنَّاسِ"],"en":"The Sovereign of mankind"}},{"ar":"مَلَكُوت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"Dominion, realm","word":"malakut","ex":{"s":36,"a":83,"p":4,"ar":["فَسُبْحَـٰنَ","ٱلَّذِى","بِيَدِهِۦ","مَلَكُوتُ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","وَإِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"en":"So exalted is He in whose hand is the realm of all things, and to Him you will be returned"}},{"ar":"مَٰلِك","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"master, owner","word":null,"ex":{"s":1,"a":4,"p":1,"ar":["مَـٰلِكِ","يَوْمِ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"en":"Sovereign of the Day of Recompense"}},{"ar":"مَٰلِك2","kind":"name","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"Malik","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":77,"p":2,"ar":["وَنَادَوْا۟","يَـٰمَـٰلِكُ","لِيَقْضِ","عَلَيْنَا","رَبُّكَ ۖ","قَالَ","إِنَّكُم","مَّـٰكِثُونَ"],"en":"And they will call, \"O Malik, let your Lord put an end to us!\" He will say, \"Indeed, you will remain"}},{"ar":"مَلِيك","kind":"noun","form":n